hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Imepokelewa kutoka kwa Uqbah ibn Amir (Allah amridhie) kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Mwenyezi Mungu awarehemu walinzi wa kundi la walinzi [Mujahidina wanaolinda Waislamu]))."
"2","[AI-translation] Uqbah ibn Amir (Allah amridhie) anasimulia kwamba Mtume wa Allah (Swalla Allahu 'alayhi wa sallam) amesema: ((Mwenyezi Mungu awarehemu walinzi wa walinzi))."
